rdable homes to luxury apartments.\n 2, 3, and 4 BHK configurations available.\n Villas and plotted developments also present.\n\n### Excellent Connectivity [...] Whitefield New Projects Logo\n\n Home\n Projects ▼ \n\n  Pre Launch Upcoming Under Construction\n Top Builders ▼ \n\n  Godrej Brigade Prestige Sobha Assetz Puravankara Mahindra Lifespaces Shriram Arvind SmartSpaces Sumadhura Group Tata Group Abhee Ventures Sowparnika Sattva Group\n Properties ▼ \n\n  Apartments ▼\n\n  2 BHK 3 BHK 4 BHK\n\n  Villas Plots\n Blog\n Contact Us\n\n# Find New Residential Projects in Whitefield, Bangalore\n\nDiscover new & upcoming residential projects in Whitefield, Bangalore 2026. Find premium apartments, villas, and plots with modern amenities, excellent connectivity, and high appreciation potential in East Bangalore’s top IT hub. Get updated price lists, floor plans, and early bird offers.\n\nNew residential projects in Whitefield Bangalore luxury apartments banner [...] New 3 BHK flats in Whitefield start from around ₹1.5 Cr and go up to ₹3.5 Cr based on the project and amenities.\n\nQ6. Do Whitefield new projects have RERA approval? \n\nMost trusted builders have RERA-approved new launch housing projects in Whitefield. It ensures safe buying and on-time delivery.\n\nQ7. Which is better: apartments or villas in Whitefield? \n\nApartments offer great amenities at a lower cost, while villas give more space and privacy. It depends on your budget and needs.\n\nQ8. What is the connectivity like from new launch projects in Whitefield? \n\nWhitefield has excellent road and metro connectivity. It is close to the IT corridor and the upcoming metro will further reduce travel time.\n\nQ9. Can I get site visit support for new launch projects in Whitefield?","score":0.30154762,"raw_content":null,"id":"6ab7fd-03"},{"url":"https://24kliving.com/blog/top-7-must-have-building-amenities-in-luxury-apartments-in-2025","title":"Luxury Apartment Amenities: 12 Must-Haves in 2026 | 24K","content":"Check official project documentation, sanctioned plans and applicable MahaRERA disclosures, and confirm with the developer which amenities are currently operational versus planned.\n\n## Conclusion\n\nLuxury apartment amenities in 2026 are best judged by quality and usability, not by how long the list looks in a brochure. Whether you're prioritising wellness, security, sustainability or everyday convenience, the amenities worth paying attention to are the ones that are well planned, properly maintained and genuinely accessible to the residents who will use them every day. Use the checklist above to compare projects on that basis, and verify what's promised against actual project documentation before you decide.\n\n24K Altura 4 BHK: Floor Plans, Carpet Area & Layout Guide - Life Republic Blog [...] ## 1. Fitness Centre & Wellness Spaces\n\nA well-planned fitness and wellness offering goes beyond a single equipment-filled room. Look for adequate equipment variety, proper ventilation and natural light, dedicated space for yoga or meditation, and separate changing facilities. Some developments include additions such as a spa, steam room or sauna, and in a few cases specialised features like cryotherapy rooms, but these remain occasional additions rather than a standard expectation, so it's worth confirming what a specific project actually offers rather than assuming a fixed list. The more useful question is whether the space is sized appropriately for the number of residents it serves. [...] Look at usability and capacity relative to the number of residents, ongoing maintenance, any additional access or usage charges, whether the amenity is actually delivered or still planned, and whether it is documented in the project's official disclosures.\n\n### Q3. Do more amenities always make an apartment project better?\n\nNo. Quality and usability matter more than the number of facilities. A long amenities list does not guarantee that the facilities are well designed, appropriately sized or properly maintained.\n\n### Q4. Are EV charging points important in modern apartment projects?","score":0.2806661,"raw_content":null,"id":"e60976-04"},{"url":"https://sattvanewlaunch.com","title":"100+ Sattva Residential Projects 2026 | New Launch, Upcoming & Pre Launch Properties","content":"Bangalore\n\nExplore More Details\n\n## How to Choose the Right Sattva Project For You?\n\nFind your ideal luxury home in a few simple steps:\n\nStep 1: Enter your name, mobile, and email to connect with a Sattva expert.\n\nStep 2: Select your preferred property type - luxury apartment, villa, or plot.\n\nStep 3: Share your budget, preferred location, and BHK configuration.\n\nStep 4: Explore Sattva's New Launch, Under-Construction, or Upcoming homes.\n\nStep 5: Receive instant access to official brochures, floor plans, and price lists.\n\nStep 6: Schedule a private site visit to experience Sattva's legendary quality firsthand.\n\nEnquire today to find your premium property and discover the Sattva legacy of promising projects, high investment potential, and world-class amenities. [...] with world-class amenities, sustainable designs, and strong investment potential, making them a preferred choice for homebuyers and investors seeking new launch, upcoming, and pre-launch residential properties in India. [...] ### Prime Strategic Locations\n\n Proximity to IT and business hubs.\n Excellent connectivity and infrastructure.\n Well-developed social amenities nearby.\n\n### World-Class Amenities\n\n Luxurious clubhouses and pools.\n Fitness centers and sports facilities.\n Beautiful landscaped gardens and open spaces.\n\n### Sustainable & Future-Ready Homes\n\n Eco-friendly construction practices.\n Energy-efficient design and smart features.\n Long-lasting and low-maintenance structures.\n\n### Ready to Book Your Dream Home With Sattva?\n\nConnect with us to get top residential projects updates, early-bird offers, floor plan & expert guidance.\n\nGet Started Now\n\n## 